flowchart TD
    A[feature/TICKET-desc branch] --> B{PR to dev}
    B --> C[CI: lint + unit tests + validate]
    C -->|Pass| D[Merge to dev]
    D --> E[Deploy to dev environment]
    E --> F{PR to staging}
    F --> G[CI gates]
    G -->|Pass| H[Merge to staging]
    H --> I[Deploy to staging + integration tests]
    I --> J{PR to main}
    J --> K[CI gates]
    K -->|Pass| L[Merge to main]
    L --> M[Deploy to production + smoke tests]
